    "answer": "The CodeAlpha Artificial Intelligence Internship is a virtual internship program designed to provide hands-on experience in AI and machine learning. Participants work on real-world projects, learn industry-relevant skills, and earn a certificate upon successful completion. The program is entirely remote and self-paced, making it accessible to students and professionals worldwide."
