    "question": "What is TASK 2 of the CodeAlpha AI Internship?",
    "answer": "TASK 2 of the CodeAlpha AI Internship requires you to build an FAQ Chatbot. The chatbot must use NLP preprocessing (tokenization, cleaning, lemmatization), TF-IDF Vectorizer and Cosine Similarity for intent matching, and include an LLM fallback mechanism when similarity scores are below a threshold. The project should have a FastAPI backend and a modern chat UI frontend."
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "question": "What libraries and tools are used in the CodeAlpha AI Internship?",
    "answer": "The CodeAlpha AI Internship involves working with various libraries and tools including: Python, FastAPI, SpaCy or NLTK for NLP, Scikit-learn for TF-IDF and similarity matching, OpenAI API for LLM integration, HTML/CSS/JavaScript for frontend development, and Git/GitHub for version control and submission. These tools cover the full stack of AI application development."
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "question": "Can I participate in the CodeAlpha AI Internship while working full-time?",
